# Allowlist for the per-machine local-dotfiles repo (~/.local/local-dotfiles.git).
# `dotfiles init` installs this as info/exclude on a fresh machine; a machine
# that has edited its copy keeps it. `dotfiles --local git --edit` edits this
# template and installs it. Only hand-written local config is tracked;
# tool-managed data, state, and caches under ~/.local never are.
#
# Every '!' entry says why on the line above it (or above its run of '!'
# lines); local_dotfiles_repo fails on one that does not.
/*
# The tier's own README: what lives here and how it relates to the shared tier.
!/README.md
# This machine's own openers and launchers, on PATH.
!/bin/
# share/ is mostly tool data; only the directories below are admitted.
!/share/
/share/*
# Scripts that only make sense on this machine, on PATH.
!/share/bin/
# This machine's zsh plugins (the shared loader sources them); history is state.
!/share/zsh/
/share/zsh/history*
# Git settings true only here: the work identity and the like.
!/share/git/
# AWS console bookmarks, one JSON file per destination.
!/share/go_aws/
# Kubernetes targets, one JSON file per context and namespace.
!/share/kuber/
# The AWS profiles this machine uses, one file each, with notes.
!/share/aws_profile/
# tmux: only the local plugins below; TPM's installs beside them are not ours.
!/share/tmux/
/share/tmux/*
# tmux plugins that exist only here, one directory each, tracked instead of installed by TPM.
!/share/tmux/local-plugins/
# Entries for the tmux one-shot menu that only make sense here.
!/share/tmux_oneshot/
# The c<name> jump-to-directory shortcuts for this machine.
!/share/double_cd/
# This machine's Brewfile and Brewfile.ignore (the local half of the brew model).
!/share/new-machine/
# This machine's dotfiles job plugins and deps.
!/share/dotfiles/
# The Claude skills that belong to this machine's tier.
!/share/claude-skills/
# The Chrome Exoskeleton's private plugins, its env and its leak denylist;
# installs, build output and test results inside it are not.
!/share/chrome-exoskeleton/
/share/chrome-exoskeleton/plugins/node_modules
/share/chrome-exoskeleton/**/examples/*
# An empty examples/ keeps its place with a .gitkeep.
!/share/chrome-exoskeleton/**/examples/.gitkeep
/share/chrome-exoskeleton/**/test-results/
# Secrets live in *.secret.zsh beside the plugin that needs them; never tracked.
*.secret.zsh
# Symlinks into tool-managed installs (claude version dir, pipx venv).
/bin/claude
/bin/pyairtable
# The private-terms denylist the plugged repo's hooks check commits against.
!/share/plugged/
# Raycast snippets: the private tier is versioned; the import manifest is machine state.
!/share/raycast-snippets/
/share/raycast-snippets/manifest.json
# Starship tables joined after the shared ~/.config/starship.toml (zsh/plugins/starship.zsh).
!/share/starship/
# tmuxinator projects found through TMUXINATOR_CONFIG (zsh/plugins/tmux.zsh).
!/share/tmuxinator/
# nvim loads site/plugin/*.lua from its data dir; the rest of share/nvim is tool state.
!/share/nvim/
/share/nvim/*
!/share/nvim/site/
/share/nvim/site/*
!/share/nvim/site/plugin/
